    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can read VRM, images, audio, and video!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A game where you can make full use of various other items to create your own naughty space.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805970/extras/77af326fcd516446bef063cc123db64b.avif?t=1752045144\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items can be placed freely, images and videos can be scaled, and audio can be stereo or 3D sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vroid can be freely posed by moving its joints.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805970/extras/fffb925d0e004f5cde85e0ae8cf200d5.avif?t=1752045144\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Backgrounds can be selected from single color, 360-degree images, MR, etc. You can also load 360-degree images and use your own favorite backgrounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805970/extras/17206c252a2f10b6fdc0d049f3c6c090.avif?t=1752045144\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time lights can also be installed. Shadows and moods can be created.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805970/extras/fc9f03a39a0dc874ada3c4bd8927b133.avif?t=1752045144\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can create your own scenes with various items such as walls, floors, chairs, tables, male genitalia, tongues, used condoms, and water guns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805970/extras/c337eeea398e4f835dc0dc3783e01c4e.avif?t=1752045144\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those with busy hands, there are items that can control ejaculation events and other events with their gaze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805970/extras/4fe0951964167270600bcb58d28d0d2f.avif?t=1752045144\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipped with a save-load function </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a scene is complete, you can save it and recall it at any time. Any number of scenes can be saved and managed in folders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805970/extras/f7a0f04c6f2b838c6d7a9786922f2a53.avif?t=1752045144\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy animation creation feature is included. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All items that can be installed can be animated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vroid can set separate animations for each joint. Of course, it can also be linked to the player's movements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805970/extras/5270ca0f5da8e7e8224501df006ee7d7.avif?t=1752045144\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can change the animation speed or set an ejaculation event at any time you like for the audio and video.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It can also be used to automatically switch between controller vibration and electric onahole operation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805970/extras/3af3952bea42698b9a1baadf7cfb70cc.avif?t=1752045144\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipped with bukkake function </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can pour white liquid on anything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interlocking of vibration of VR controller and electric masturbator</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The VR controller vibrates in accordance with the animation and VR controller operation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It also works with an electric masturbator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Confirmed with A10 Cyclone SA and The Handy. )</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: Electric masturbators are only available for PCVR </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: MR is only eligible to work with Quest standalone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Supported files </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For PC version </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Image : .JPG .jpg .bmp .png (png also supports transparency) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gif : .gif</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movie ; .mp4 .avi (may not play depending on compression format) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound : .aif .wav .mp3 .ogg </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VRM : .vrm (VRM0.x VRM 1.x supported) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Panoramic : .exr .JPG .jpg .bmp .gif .png </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For MetaQuest package version </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Image : .JPG .jpg .bmp .png (png also supports transparency) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gif : .gif</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movie ; .mp4 (May not play depending on compression format. Sound : .aif .wav .mp3 .ogg </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VRM : .vrm (VRM0.x VRM 1.x supported) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Panoramic : .exr .JPG .jpg .bmp .gif .png</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Controls </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cLeft Analog Stick\u201d Move </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cRight Analog Stick\u201d Turn, Height Adjust </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cTrigger\u201d Select </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2018Grip\u2019 Grab </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cAX Button\u201d Mini Menu </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cBY Button\u201d Menu</p>",
